  "s.66O(3)",
  "(3) 在以下情况下，就第(2)款所指的免责辩护而需要确立的事宜，须视作已由有关的人确 立 — — (a) 有足够证据，就该事宜带出争论点；及 (b) 控方没有提出足以排除合理疑点的证据，证明并非如此。",
  "(3) The person is taken to have established a matter that needs to be established for the purpose of a defence under subsection (2) if— (a) there is sufficient evidence to raise an issue with respect to the matter; and (b) the contrary is not proved by the prosecution beyond reasonable doubt.",

